<title>USA: Jackson County Housing, Ore., yields 6.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Jackson County Housing, Ore., yields 6.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it priced $4.370 million Jackson County Housing Authority, Ore., multi-family housing mortgage revenue bonds, with a top yield of 6.30 percent in 2027.</p>
